  "notes": "すくう is a godan verb meaning to scoop or ladle.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n- Pattern: Xを すくう\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- すくっている: in the process of scooping\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {金魚|きんぎょ}をすくう (to scoop goldfish)\n- スープをすくう (to ladle soup)\n- {水|みず}をすくう (to scoop up water)\n- {手|て}ですくう (to scoop with one's hands)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {金魚|きんぎょ}すくい: goldfish scooping (festival game)\n- {玉|たま}すくい: ball scooping game\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {救|すく}う (to save, rescue) - different kanji, different meaning",
